{"id":"HAD-1694","recordType":"athar","language":"de","narratorLine":"Sufyān aṯ-Ṯawrī رحمه الله sagte:","speakerLabel":"Er sagte:","textMarkdown":"Behandle die Menschen so, wie du möchtest, dass sie dich **behandeln**.","source":"Abū Nuʿaym, Ḥilyat al-Awliyāʾ","grade":"Salaf-Aussage","verificationNote":"100er-Schritt 1651–1750; 20er-Salaf-Unterblock."}